  "description": "Video capture SDK for .NET (C#, VB.NET, WinForms, WPF, console): TVideoGrabber is a video capture, recording, streaming and playback component for Windows 10/11. Captures webcams, USB/HDMI/PCIe capture devices and the desktop screen; connects to ONVIF, RTSP, RTMP and HTTP IP cameras (with the Datastead RTSP/RTMP/HTTP/ONVIF DirectShow source filter); records to MP4, MKV, AVI, MPEG-TS, WMV with H.264/HEVC hardware encoding (NVIDIA NVENC, Intel QuickSync, AMD AMF) and streams to RTSP, RTMP, UDP, HLS (with the Datastead Multipurpose DirectShow Encoder); plays media files with frame-accurate seeking; frame capture, text and image overlays, picture-in-picture, mixing of several sources, motion detection, 360-degree video, AES encryption. Multiple instances per application. Evaluation version with a nag screen: a license is required for deployment (https://www.datastead.com/purchase/).",
